                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It crashes if you don't disable the preloading shaders, so disable them if the game crashes at the loading screens. It's still a good game, though. I had to rush through it because I was feeling too nostalgic to play it normally. I love the satisfying hit marker effects. I don't know why that is, but I like it. I like it a lot. Took me a few hours to complete. Probably better than the original since they added new features to the game. It is still a lot of fun. Just remember to disable the preloading shaders option to keep the game from crashing at the loading screens. The sound effects is what makes this game replay able for me. There's just something to it. 11/10",
